    <skt>yak+Sha ma ru guh+ya tan+t+ra</skt>
    <coloph>de nas dpa' bo gar mkhan mchog dag/ gshin rje gshed po dam tshig lung du bstod pa'o// hu'Mnamkha' yangs pa'i dkyil 'khor nas// gshin rje d+mar po ral pa can// ru t.a myur du bsgral ba'i phyir// sgrub pa'i gnas 'dir dam la shog/ zhes dam bsgrags te bstod do// de nas dpa' bo gar mkhan la 'khor sems dpa' sems dang ma la sogs pas// bstod pa gar dang bcas pa/ hu'M sngon gyi rgyal bas lung phog ltar// tshe srog bdag po ma ru tse// sgrol ging bya bar dam bcas pas// dam rdzas bdud nyid 'di la kha raM kha hi// zhes gus pas mchod cing bstod do// de nas bcom ldan 'das kyis bshad pa// rnal 'byor can gyi rtog pa gzhom pa'i phyir// ma ru tse'i gar mkhan chog nyido// gar mkhan chog nyid rgyal po rnam thos sras// rnam thos sras nyid kar ma he ru ka/ don la the tshom med na rigs lnga'i sangs rgyas grub// dpa' bo gar mkhan mchog gi rgyud las// gnod sbying d+mar po'i tan+t+ra// gso byed spu gri'i so// las kyi mchog/ man ngag gi nying khu/ bdud gyi mda'/ las kyi gshin rje zhes bya'o// //gshin rje wa thod d+mar po'i rgyud tsha rgod d+myal ba'i las rdzogs so</coloph>
